{%- comment -%}
  N&N configurator — rendered inside bySizeNew via a `custom_liquid` block.
  Header pieces (rating / title / description / price / trust grid / save bar /
  fastest delivery / etc.) come from bySizeNew's own blocks. This snippet
  only renders the configurator zone: jersey preview, step cards, roster,
  hidden line-item-property inputs, and the inline checkout summary.

  Hidden inputs use `form="product-form-{{ section.id }}"` so they submit
  through bySizeNew's existing product form (rendered by its `buy_buttons` block).
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'names-and-numbers.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

